    11304       enable
    11305       buf_price-doc-forming-gds.price-sale-doc
    11306       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 99.75 BY 7.75 ROW-HEIGHT-CHARS .6 FIT-LAST-COLUMN.
