    15134   define variable vss-include-info126 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
    15135   on f5 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere
    15136   do:
    15137     run OpenBr in this-procedure (yes, no, '':U).
    15138       apply "VALUE-CHANGED" to BROWSE-1.
